    "text": "Abraham exemplum fideliter credentium fuit Her Abraham bysene onstealde geleaffullum, \u00fea he wolde\nUbi quinque reges predati sunt Loth Her \u00fea fif cyningas mit hu\u00f0e l\u00e6ddan Loth gebundenne.\nAbram post praedones currit Her Abram \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re.\nAbram devictis hostibus recepto Loth cum victoria revertitur Her Abram oferwunnenum feondum\nUbi Abram decimas offert et Melchisedech Habrahae panem et vinum, Melchisedech rex et sacerdos dei\nUbi tres angeli apparent Abrahe in convalle Mambre.\nPrudentius orat Her seo gleawnes heo gebit.\nFides secura adhuc belli ignara idolatriam repugnat prima Her se goda geleafa \u00e6rest ongean \u00fe\u00e6t\nFides conculcat idolatriam Her se geleafa ofertret \u00fe\u00e6t deofolgyld.\nFides post victoriam virtutes coronat Her se geleafa \u00e6fter \u00feam sige cynehelmode \u00fea m\u00e6gnu.\nPudicitia contra libidinem armis pugnat Her seo cl\u00e6nnes mid w\u00e6pnum win\u00f0 ongean \u00fea fulnesse.\nPudicitia libidinem cum saxo percutit Her seo cl\u00e6nnes \u00fea fulnesse mid flinte torfa\u00f0.\nPudicitia libidinem transfigit gladio Her nes.\nPudicitia libidinem extinctam increpat Her seo cl\u00e6nnes \u00fea fulnesse ofercumene \u00ferea\u00f0.\nSancta pudicitia gladium purificat Seo halige cl\u00e6nnes \u00fe\u00e6t sweord feorma\u00f0.\nPudicitia gladium suum sub altare in templo recondit Seo cl\u00e6nnes hyre sweord under \u00feam weofode on\nUbi patientia inter acies vitiorum intrepida stat Her werode.\nIra patientiam conto percutit Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feyld mid \u00feam sceafte slih\u00f0.\nIra patientiam increpat Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feyld stent, \u00ferea\u00f0.\nIra lanceam suam iacit contra patientiam Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre hys spere scota\u00f0 ongean \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld.\nArma fracta, quae miserat ira contra patientiam Her \u00fea w\u00e6p, weor\u00f0a to cene, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t yrre sende ongean\nIra patientiam gladio percutit \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld mid sweorde sloh.\nGladius ire frangitur in capite patientiae Sweord \u00fe\u00e6s yrres tobrocen wear\u00f0 on heafde \u00fe\u00e6s ge\u00f0yldes.\nIra se sagitta interficit Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre hit sylf mid flane ofstang.\nPatientia victrix iram mortuam increpat \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld oferswi\u00f0ende \u00fe\u00e6t yrre dead hit \u00fereade.\nPatientia cum Iob medias acies transit \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld mid Iobe on middeweardum werode for.\nPatientia cum Iob loquitur \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld wi\u00f0 Iob spr\u00e6c.\nPatientia devictis vitiis ad virtutes loquitur \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld ofercumenum leahtrum to \u00feam m\u00e6gnum spr\u00e6c.\nSuperbia in turmas effreni volitat aequo Seo ofermodnes on heape ungemidledum horse fleah.\nSuperbia aequitat Her seo ofermodnes rad.\nSuperbia in equo minatur turbis, humilitas et spes intrepidae stant Seo ofermodnes on horse \u00feywde \u00fe\u00e6t\nSuperbia inruere vult super humilitatem et spem Seo ofermodnes stellan wile ofer ea\u00f0modnesse and\nSuperbia cadit in fovem Her seo ofermodnes feol, \u00fe\u00e6t heo on \u00feone fulan sea\u00f0 l\u00e6g.\nHumilitas deridet superbiam iacentem Seo ea\u00f0modnes hloh \u00fe\u00e6re ofermodignesse fylles.\nSuperbia iacit humilitati spes offert gladium Se hopa ar\u00e6hte sweord \u00fe\u00e6re ea\u00f0modnesse.\nHumilitas amputat caput superbiae Seo ea\u00f0modnes of acearf heafod \u00fe\u00e6re ofermodignesse.\nHumilitas caput superbiae offert spei Seo ea\u00f0modnes heafod \u00fe\u00e6re ofermodignesse ar\u00e6hte \u00feam hopan.\nExtinctam superbiam spes increpat Oferwunnenre \u00fe\u00e6re ofermodignesse se hopa heo \u00fereade.\nHumilitas ascendit in caelum, virtutes mirantur eam Seo ea\u00f0modnes astah on heofon, and \u00fea m\u00e6gnu\nLuxuria in caena sedit Seo galnes \u00e6t hyre \u00e6fengereordum sitt.\nLuxuria auditis tubis ad bellum currit Seo galnes gehyrendum byman to \u00feam gefeohte arn.\nLuxuriam mirantur viri in curru \u00fe\u00e6re galnesse wundredon weras on \u00feam cr\u00e6te.\nLuxuria blandimentis virtutes decipit Seo galnes sw\u00e6sum wordum \u00fea m\u00e6gnu beswac.\nViri deiectis armis sequuntur luxuriam Her weras aworpenum w\u00e6pnum fylgedon \u00fe\u00e6re galnesse.\nCuncta acies versis signis ad deditionem transit Eal werod gehwyrfedum tacnum to \u00fe\u00e6re biswicenesse\nSobrietas increpat acies dicens, ne sequantur luxuriam Her seo syfernes \u00fereade \u00fe\u00e6t werod cwe\u00f0ende,\nSobrietas crucem domini offert currui luxuriae Seo syfernes drihtnes rode brohte ongean \u00fe\u00e6re galnesse\nSobrietas lapidem iacit et percutit os luxuriae Seo syfernes mid stane wearp \u00fea galnesse on \u00feone mu\u00f0,\nSobrietas increpat luxuriam extinctam Seo syfernes \u00fereade \u00fea galnesse ofercumene.\nIocus cymbala proiciens fugit Her \u00feara cymbala stow aworpen w\u00e6s.\nAmor, qui et cupido, faretram, arcum et sagittas dimittens fugit Seo lufu \u00fe\u00e6re gr\u00e6dignesse cocor and\nPompa ornamenta sua proiciens fugit Se woruldwela his fr\u00e6tewunga aweorpende fleah.\nVoluptas laceratis pedibus per spinas fugit Seo gelustfullung gewundedum fotum \u00feurh \u00fea \u00feornas fleah.\nSobrietas et alie virtutes abstinent se a spoliis Seo syfernes and o\u00f0re m\u00e6gnu forh\u00e6fdon heo fram\nAvaritia aurum inter arenas legit Her seo gytsung hyre gold betweoh \u00fea w\u00e6ter\u00e6dran r\u00e6t.\nAvaritia spolia in sinistro latere protegit Seo gytsung hyre reaf on \u00fe\u00e6re wynstran sidan scylt.\nMultitudinem vitiorum avaritia nigro lacte nutrit Micel leahtra menigeo seo gytsung sweartre meolce\nAvaritia multos sternit, alios cecos errare sinit Her seo gytsung manega ofertret and o\u00f0re blinde dwelian\nAvaritia, dum aliquid boni ostendit, iaculo percutere vult Her seo gytsung \u00feonne heo \u00e6nigne godne\nAvaritia multos precipitat in ignem Her seo gytsung manega bescyf\u00f0 on fyr.\nAvaritia transformatur in habitum honestum Her seo gytsung gehiwod w\u00e6s weor\u00f0lice on gegyrelan.\nAvaritia fallit Her seo gytsung leas spel s\u00e6gde \u00feam folce.\nAvaritia hos, quos fallit, ligat Her seo gytsung wra\u00f0 \u00fea, \u00fee heo \u00e6r leas spel s\u00e6gde.\nVirtutes dubitant avaritiam non plene cognoscentes Her \u00feam m\u00e6gnu tweonedon be \u00fe\u00e6re gytsunge, \u00fe\u00e6t\nLargitas pugnat contra avaritiam et spolia eius pauperibus erogat Her seo rumgifolnes win\u00f0 ongean \u00fea\nAvaritia stupefacta fatescit Her seo gytsung wundrede hyre geteorodnesse.\nLargitas avaritiam ligat Her seo rumgyfolnes \u00fea gytsunge wra\u00f0.\nLargitas avaritiam genibus et calcibus perfodit Her seo rumgyfolnes \u00fea gytsunge mid cneowum and\nLargitas spolia avaritiae pauperibus dat Her seo rumgyfolnes reaf \u00fe\u00e6re gytsunge \u00feearfum d\u00e6lde.\nLargitas cum gaudio turbas alloquitur Seo rumgyfolnes mid gefean to \u00feam folce sp\u00e6c.\nPax venit, et fugiunt metus et labor et vis Her seo gesibsumnes com, and fleah se ege and \u00fe\u00e6t geswinc\nTubae silent, gladii reconduntur in vaginas Her \u00fea byman swigedon and \u00fea sweord on hiora scea\u00f0um\nVirtutum legio gaudet victo certamine Her \u00fea m\u00e6gnu \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6wf\u00e6stnesse blissia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s gewunnenan\nConcordia iubet reducere vexilla in castris Her seo ge\u00few\u00e6rnes het beran \u00fea gu\u00f0fanan in on \u00f0a ceastre.\nTurba psallentium equitum ac pedestrium \u00feis is \u00fe\u00e6t hleo\u00f0rigende folc ridende and eac fotum gangende.\nVirtutes urbem ingrediuntur Her \u00fea m\u00e6gnu in on \u00fea burh ganga\u00f0.\nDiscordia occultae vulnerat concordiam Her seo unge\u00f0w\u00e6rnes dygollice wundode \u00fea ge\u00f0w\u00e6rnesse.\nDiscordia virtutibus insidiatur et capitur Her seo unge\u00f0w\u00e6rnes \u00fea m\u00e6gnu syrwde and geh\u00e6fte.\nFides virtutum turmas alloquitur Her se geleafa \u00feara m\u00e6gna wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t werod spec\u00f0.\nFides et caritas mentiuntur locum, ubi templum domini aedificetur Se geleafa and seo lufu m\u00e6ton \u00feone\nHic templum domini Her is drihtnes templ.\nDomus interior, ubi sapientia sedet \u00feis is \u00fe\u00e6t hus, \u00fe\u00e6r se wisdom on innan sit.\nPrudentius gratias deo agit Her seo gleawnes de\u00f0 gode \u00feanc.",
